# Prose-word budgets (scripts/doc-form.sh): path=N share=S. N is the base prose words; ARCHITECTURE.md adds 280 words for 11 cell-expansion headings (24) and summaries (256), docs/DATA-FLOW.md adds 48 for 2 headings (6) and summaries (42), threatmodel/AGENT-THREAT-MODEL.md adds 181 for 6 headings (18) and summaries (163).
# ARCHITECTURE.md 5267 adds 29 words of alt text for the cluster figure in Deployment surface.
# ARCHITECTURE.md 5278 adds 11: recordings named as optional and kept in their own store, not in the audit log.
# ARCHITECTURE.md 5309 adds 31: invariant 6 names the successful broker mint, whose audit row rides the mint transaction.
ARCHITECTURE.md=5309 share=35
SECURITY.md=999 share=35
PROVENANCE.md=798 share=35
docs/DATA-FLOW.md=1200 share=35
